---
/**
 * FailureLabBoard.astro - Hero 3: What a failed upgrade leaves behind
 * Interactive lab with 5 presets: no-wait, wait, rollback, cleanup, interrupted.
 */
---
<div class="helm-failure-lab" data-helm-failure-lab>
  <div class="helm-lab-toolbar">
    <span class="helm-lab-label">SIMULATE FAILURE SCENARIOS:</span>
    <div class="helm-preset-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Failure presets">
      <button type="button" class="helm-preset-btn is-active" data-preset="rollback">1. --rollback-on-failure (Default Recommended)</button>
      <button type="button" class="helm-preset-btn" data-preset="cleanup">2. + --cleanup-on-fail</button>
      <button type="button" class="helm-preset-btn" data-preset="wait">3. --wait (no rollback)</button>
      <button type="button" class="helm-preset-btn" data-preset="no-wait">4. No --wait (Silent Failure)</button>
      <button type="button" class="helm-preset-btn" data-preset="interrupted">5. Interrupted Run (Stuck Lock)</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="helm-lab-content">
    <div class="helm-lab-col">
      <h3>Command & Flags Run in CI</h3>
      <div class="helm-command-box">
        <code data-helm-cmd>helm upgrade --install payment-api ./charts/payment-api \
  --namespace payments \
  -f values-prod.yaml \
  --set image.tag=4.7.2-rc \
  --rollback-on-failure</code>
      </div>

      <div class="helm-cli-result">
        <span class="helm-badge" data-helm-cli-badge>EXIT CODE 1 (FAILED)</span>
        <pre><code data-helm-cli-output>Error: UPGRADE FAILED: release payment-api failed, and has been rolled back due to --rollback-on-failure
Deployment.apps "payment-api" is invalid: ImagePullBackOff (tag 4.7.2-rc not found)
Rolled back release payment-api to revision 2</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="helm-lab-col">
      <h3>In-Cluster Result (Namespace: payments)</h3>
      <div class="helm-cluster-status">
        <div class="helm-status-row">
          <span>Release Secret History:</span>
          <b class="helm-ledger-state" data-helm-ledger>v1 (superseded) → v2 (superseded) → v3 (failed) → v4 (deployed, rollback to 2)</b>
        </div>
        <div class="helm-status-row">
          <span>Active Deployment Pods:</span>
          <b class="helm-pod-state" data-helm-pods>Pods running stable image payments/api:4.7.1 (Service healthy)</b>
        </div>
        <div class="helm-status-row">
          <span>New Resources from v3:</span>
          <b class="helm-extra-state" data-helm-extra>ConfigMap payment-api-flags remains (use --cleanup-on-fail to purge)</b>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="helm-operator-action">
        <h4>Operator Verdict & Immediate Next Action</h4>
        <p data-helm-action>Cluster workloads remained online! Release ledger advanced to v4 (which mirrors v2's configuration). Fix the image tag in Git before triggering CI again.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.helm-failure-lab {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 1rem;
  background: var(--surface-bg, #161a22);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle, #30363d);
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
}
.helm-lab-toolbar {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle, #30363d);
  padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.helm-lab-label {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--text-muted, #8b949e);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
.helm-preset-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.4rem;
}
.helm-preset-btn {
  background: var(--chip-bg, #21262d);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle, #30363d);
  color: #c9d1d9;
  padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  transition: all 0.15s ease;
}
.helm-preset-btn:hover {
  background: #30363d;
}
.helm-preset-btn.is-active {
  background: #1f6feb;
  color: #fff;
  border-color: #58a6ff;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.helm-lab-content {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1.25rem;
}
@media (max-width: 840px) {
  .helm-lab-content {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
.helm-lab-col h3 {
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-muted, #8b949e);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
.helm-command-box {
  background: #0d1117;
  border: 1px solid #30363d;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 0.6rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}
.helm-command-box code {
  color: #79c0ff;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-family: monospace;
}
.helm-cli-result {
  background: #0d1117;
  border: 1px solid #f85149;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 0.6rem;
}
.helm-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
  border-radius: 3px;
  background: #da3633;
  color: white;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}
.helm-cli-result pre {
  margin: 0;
  color: #ffa198;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
}
.helm-cluster-status {
  background: #0d1117;
  border: 1px solid #30363d;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 0.6rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}
.helm-status-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.2rem;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}
.helm-status-row span {
  color: #8b949e;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}
.helm-status-row b {
  color: #e6edf3;
  font-family: monospace;
}
.helm-operator-action {
  background: #1c2128;
  border-left: 3px solid #58a6ff;
  padding: 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
}
.helm-operator-action h4 {
  margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: #58a6ff;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.helm-operator-action p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: #c9d1d9;
}
</style>
